        record is about, so it discloses restricted information more readily
        than a title does — which is why it is worth substituting explicitly
        rather than leaving an application to decide.

        Note that RecordAbstract is itself optional in Kapsel: a record with no
        abstract at all simply has none to show, and omitting both elements is
        not an error.
